<title>HONG KONG: Trading of Shun Shing shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading of Shun Shing shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of construction and property development firm Shun Shing Holdings Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>Shun Shing shares rose HK$0.14 to HK$0.99 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>In December, Cosco (H.K.) Property Development Ltd, a unit of COSCO (Hong Kong) Group Ltd, agreed to buy a 30 percent stake in Shun Shing.</p>
<p>COSCO (Hong Kong) is the holding company of COSCO Pacific Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
